` THE LOGO of the drafts by itself: the title and its splash, over black and then over white, so that
` build/capsule_drafts.py can key it out (for the library logo, and the small capsule). the black or white is at
` order 150: over everything of the sea, and under the splash (200) and the words (293 to 297).
test capsule_draft_logo from capDraftShot
    if val(env$("FISH_CAPSULE")) = 0 then end
    tCdlOut$ = env$("FISH_CAPSULE_OUT")
    if tCdlOut$ = "" then tCdlOut$ = "capsules"
    capDraftSmokes(TEX_SMOKE_1, TEX_SMOKE_2)
    trailerNoUi()
    trailerFishAway()
    hide sprite SCORE_TEXT_VIEW_SPRITE
    tCdlBack = 0
    reserve sprite id(tCdlBack)
    sprite tCdlBack, 0, 0, TEX_PIXEL
    set sprite offset tCdlBack, 0, 0
    size sprite tCdlBack, WORLD_WIDTH, WORLD_HEIGHT
    order sprite tCdlBack, 150
    capDraftTitle(285, 175, 1.1, -.08)
    capDraftSplash()
    for tCdlBg = 0 to 1
        if tCdlBg = 0 then color sprite tCdlBack, rgb(0, 0, 0)
        if tCdlBg = 1 then color sprite tCdlBack, rgb(255, 255, 255)
        for tCdlF = 0 to 20
            hintShow(0)
            trailerHideBut(-1, -1, -1, -1)
            set sprite alpha SELECTION_SPRITE, 0
            runto update_frame
        next
        tCdlName$ = "draftlogo_black"
        if tCdlBg = 1 then tCdlName$ = "draftlogo_white"
        screenshot tCdlOut$ + "/raw/" + tCdlName$
        print "[capsule] take " + tCdlName$
    next
endtest

` THE WORDS of the drafts' logo, one at a time, with no splash: the same title in the same place as
` capsule_draft_logo, but only one word of it showing, over black and then over white. the website keys each out
` (build/capsule_drafts.py writes capsules/logo_words) and floats them, each on its own.
test capsule_draft_words from capDraftShot
    if val(env$("FISH_CAPSULE")) = 0 then end
    tCdwOut$ = env$("FISH_CAPSULE_OUT")
    if tCdwOut$ = "" then tCdwOut$ = "capsules"
