` THE GAME STARTING, the way it does for a player: the stars, the camera coming down with the menu hidden,
` the logo coming up out of the sea, and the menu fading in under it. not part of the trailer. nothing is
` remembered and nobody is at the keys, the same as in a trailer shot, but the menu is not skipped.
test trailer_menu_splash
    if val(env$("FISH_TRAILER")) = 0 then end
    randomize 7
    mock get pref
    endmock 0
    mock set pref
    endmock
    mock begin pref batch
    endmock
    mock end pref batch
    endmock
    mock action down
    endmock 0
    mock new action down
    endmock 0
    tMsOut$ = env$("FISH_TRAILER_OUT")
    record start tMsOut$ + "/trailer_menu_splash.mp4"
    for tMsF = 0 to 1500
        if tMsF = 1450
            screenshot tMsOut$ + "/trailer_menu_splash_still"
        endif
        runto frame_menu_render
    next
    record stop
    end
endtest
